{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"部分段落把留不住亲密的痛楚具体化为怕自己太黏、怕对方嫌弃、希望确认自己也被需要，主线一度偏向关系安全感与被需要感。\",\n    \"S06-S09 对对方是否需要自己、是否也舍不得的揣测，占据了一些篇幅，使失去亲密本身的痛楚暂时转向对方是否同样依恋自己的疑虑。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"前半段逐渐把痛楚具体化为渴望对方主动靠近、回应心意、确认自己在对方心中特别，容易从亲密幸福与其不可留住的痛楚转向单方面期待回应。\",\n    \"S12-S14 明显转向想象并渴望两人一起过日子，痛楚的对象也从眼下亲密可能消逝，扩展为未来共同生活无法实现。这使另一件相近但不同的事逐渐成为主线。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X 更持续地围绕眼下亲密带来的幸福，以及明知无法保证它长久却又舍不得的痛楚展开，两者反复相互牵动。Y 虽然前半段也很贴近 Center，但后半段逐渐以渴望相互珍惜和共同生活为核心，发生了主线转移。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1bfd7ea7-f7aa-430b-8f0b-59e62203648a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T075341498619Z", "elapsed_seconds": 18.641, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:54:00.156551+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7366dd9f890481429285004841f2ae405a5ec94fa51753f60fd9b49dd0a47d99", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f